1011→// LookupSessionLog is a convenience function that opens the repository and retrieves
1012→// a session log by checkpoint ID. This is the primary entry point for callers that
1013→// don't already have a GitStore instance.
1014→// Returns ErrCheckpointNotFound if the checkpoint doesn't exist.
